ntential forms that still contain nonterminals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-derivation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfg-derivation","status":"resolved","id":"76137a7886cfb97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Rightarrow_G^*$ (derivation closure, see [[73-df-cfg-derivation]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow_G^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}context\\text{-}free\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(G)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\langle S\\rangle\\Rightarrow_G^*w\\}","display":true},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false}],"bytes":1452,"backlinks":[{"id":"a3d61b5dd7be385b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$w\\in\\Sigma^*$，$L\\in\\mathsf{CFL}_{\\Sigma}$。树、产出、语言见 [[73-df-cfg-tree-yield]]、[[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]。"},{"id":"3b0149ed221ad66a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$，$\\alpha,\\beta\\in(V\\cup\\Sigma)^*$。可空集见 [[73-df-cfg-nullable-variables]]，文法语言见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]]。"},{"id":"83639a9615c06195","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L(G)$ (language generated by a grammar, see [[73-df-cfg-generated-language]])"},{"id":"e138531b17f3eae8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{CFG}_{\\Sigma}$；推导语言见 [[73-df-cfg-generated-langua